{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":33736,"duration_api_ms":33708,"num_turns":4,"result":"All changes are confirmed in place and all tests pass. Here is the ExecutionPayload:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Fixed gas-exchange scaling so total O2/CO2 surface flux depends on exposed surface area rather than water volume. Added REFERENCE_SA_V_CM2_PER_L constant (1000.0/19.0 ≈ 52.63 cm²/L) to dissolved_oxygen.rs, calibrated to the default tank geometry (40×25 cm footprint, ~19 L net water). Modified compute_o2_kla() to normalise the hardware-derived raw K_LA by (actual_SA_V / reference_SA_V), so two tanks with the same footprint but different fill heights exchange the same total mass per hour at the air–water interface. Since compute_co2_kla() delegates to compute_o2_kla(), the fix applies to both O2 and CO2 paths. Rewrote test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume to assert physically correct invariants: (1) equal surface flux (total DIC mass change within 10% for same-footprint tanks), and (2) faster concentration change in the shallower tank (shallow > deep × 1.1). For the default geometry the SA/V ratio equals the reference, so the normalisation multiplier is 1.0 and all existing default-geometry tests are unaffected.\",\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"The SA/V normalisation assumes process parameters (reaeration_kla_base, aeration_kla_boost) were calibrated for the default geometry. If custom geometries with extreme SA/V ratios are used (e.g., very tall narrow tanks), the linear scaling may overestimate K_LA — but this is physically correct behavior and the Euler cap at 1.0 remains as a safety guard.\",\n    \"Pre-existing test failure trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers in budget_helpers.rs remains unrelated to gas exchange and outside this task's scope.\"\n  ],\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Read dissolved_oxygen.rs and geometry.rs to understand the existing K_LA computation and available SA/V helpers\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Added REFERENCE_SA_V_CM2_PER_L constant (1000.0/19.0) to dissolved_oxygen.rs with documentation explaining the calibration basis\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Modified compute_o2_kla() to compute sa_v = surface_area_cm2() / volume_l and return raw_kla * (sa_v / REFERENCE_SA_V_CM2_PER_L) instead of bare raw_kla, making surface flux area-proportional\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Rewrote test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume in co2_exchange.rs to assert equal surface flux (total DIC mass change < 10% relative diff) and faster concentration change in the shallower tank (shallow > deep × 1.1)\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo test --test co2_exchange --test chemistry --test dissolved_oxygen: 38/38 passed (12 co2_exchange + 21 chemistry + 5 dissolved_oxygen)\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo fmt --check: clean, no formatting issues\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran cargo clippy --all-targets: only pre-existing warnings in tank_harness (items_after_test_module, len_zero), no new warnings in tank_core\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test co2_exchange: 12 passed, 0 failed — includes rewritten test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume asserting equal surface flux and faster concentration change in shallow tank\",\n    \"cargo test --test chemistry: 21 passed, 0 failed — carbonate solver and pH integration intact\",\n    \"cargo test --test dissolved_oxygen: 5 passed, 0 failed — shared K_LA infrastructure with SA/V normalisation works correctly\",\n    \"cargo fmt --check: clean, exit 0\",\n    \"cargo clippy --all-targets: only pre-existing warnings in tank_harness (not in scope), no new warnings\",\n    \"test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume: shallow tank (20cm fill, ~27L) and deep tank (35cm fill, ~54L) with same 60×30cm footprint — surface flux relative difference < 10%, concentration change in shallow tank > deep × 1.1\",\n    \"Default geometry (40×25cm, 22cm fill, 3cm substrate → ~19L): SA/V = 1000/19 = REFERENCE_SA_V_CM2_PER_L, so normalisation multiplier = 1.0, all existing tests unaffected\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3a6e0fba-419d-4c21-8162-56b82cdcb1dc","total_cost_usd":0.32456025,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":37119,"cache_read_input_tokens":104343,"output_tokens":1615,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":37119,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":1615,"cacheReadInputTokens":104343,"cacheCreationInputTokens":37119,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.32456025,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"b867edee-388e-4ed8-a4a2-01a0f50edf56"}
